  "system": {
    "description": {
      "value": "<p>When a creature you can see within 30 feet of yourself makes an attack roll, you can take a Reaction to roll one Hemocraft die and subtract the number rolled from the attack roll. You can use this curse after the creature rolls but before the DM determines whether the attack hits. A creature is immune to this curse if it is immune to the Blinded condition.</p><p><strong>Amplify.</strong> The curse applies to all the creature's attack rolls until the end of its turn. Roll separately for each affected attack.</p>",
